OL,3,GNEWSAWhy can't my SEND child take the
OL,4,Abus with friends?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe mother of a child with severe
OL,7,Fdisabilities said her son cannot
OL,8,Funderstand why he can no longer travel
OL,9,Fto school on a bus with his friends.
OL,11,FConor, who lives in Flitwick,
OL,12,FBedfordshire, was previously picked up
OL,13,Fby a bus that took him to his special
OL,14,Fneeds school, but the route has changed
OL,15,Fand his mother said no suitable
OL,16,Falternative transport has been offered.
OL,18,FHis mother, Lisa, no longer has the use
OL,19,Fof a car so Conor is stranded at home.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
